SUMMARY:Davis Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Davis Music Festival (DMF) is a three day multi-venue\, multi-genre live music event showcasing local\, regional and touring artists – all to benefit our local public schools’ art\, music and performing arts programs… all proceeds are donated to to support local arts education and performance opportunities for up and coming artists. It’s like our own version of SXSW in a single weekend\, and for a great cause! \nThis event is all ages. The festival takes place rain or shine (though we probably will never have to worry about rain on a June day in Davis\, CA). Tickets are non-refundable and non-transferable. Lineup and daily schedules are subject to change. Artist cancellation is not grounds for refund. \nFor further information and questions\, visit davismusicfest.com. If you are experiencing any technical issues related to online ticketing\, please contact us at info@davismusicfest.com \nHave questions about DMF? Contact the Davis Music Festival team. \n\nEARLY-BIRD FESTIVAL (3-day) PASS: $30 (expires March 19\, 2026)\nPRESALE FESTIVAL (3-day) PASS: $40 (expires June 19\, 2026)\nDAY-OF FESTIVAL (3-day) PASS: $50 (in-person purchase only)\n\nSingle day admission is available Friday and Sunday only\, at the door only. $20
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/davis-music-festival/
LOCATION:CA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/DavisMusicFest-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
