DESCRIPTION:One game. One world. One Davis. 4 pre-game parties June & July 2026 to kick off the World Cup. Enjoy pre-game party\, watch the game\, food & drinks and post-game activities. \n\nFriday\, June 12 – USA vs Paraguay\nFriday\, June 19 – USA vs Australia\nThursday\, June 25 – USA vs Türkiye\nSunday\, July 19 – World Cup Final\n\nFor more information: davisdowntown.com/davis-soccer-fest
