DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T150000
SUMMARY:Art in Action: Pressed Flower Suncatchers
DESCRIPTION:Pence Family Art Workshops\nCreate the perfect artwork to hang
  in your window! Using a circle punch\, branches\, pressed flowers\, and o
 ther materials\, craft your very own suncatcher filled with flowers and le
 aves.\n\nArt in Action: Pressed Flower Suncatchers\nSaturday\, July 25\, 1
 -3 PM\n$5 Members\, $10 Non-Members (per person\, all materials included)\
 n\n**How it works:**\nArt in Action engages kids in art projects that are 
 fun\, creative\, and collaborative with their family members. This is a dr
 op-in program for ages 5-12. No registration in advance is required\, but 
 space and supplies are limited to the first 25 participants and are availa
 ble on a first come\, first served basis.\n\nWhen you arrive\, pay with ca
 sh or card at the front desk. A parent or adult caregiver is required to s
 tay\, but only has to pay for the project for themselves if they are also 
 doing art. Stay as long or as short as you like over the two hour period.\
 n\nBecome a Member starting at $70/year and save! If you join the Pence Ga
 llery when you attend this workshop\, you can enjoy Member pricing for Art
  in Action\, plus receive a $5 gift certificate to our gift shop as a than
 k you. Membership supports art for all ages and makes creative moments lik
 e this possible—jump in and be part of it.\n\nWe have a different Art in
  Action family workshop every month. Learn more at [https://pencegallery.o
 rg/art-in-action/](https://pencegallery.org/art-in-action/).\n\nThis month
 ly program is generously sponsored by Mary Stephens DeWall & Les DeWall.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/art-in-action/events/315190316/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260609T231710Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260609T231710Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
